    [
      "P027",
      "10. INSPECTION AND MAINTENANCE",
      true,
      "heading",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "- Before any inspection of the pump, check that the unit cannot be started unintentionally.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "- The system is to be without pressure and drained of liquid.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "- The repairman must be familiar with the type of liquid which has been pumped as well\nas with the safety measures he is to take when handling the liquid.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "- Inspect the shaft seal for leaks at regular intervals.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "- Activate the relief valve at regular intervals in order to check the function.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P033",
      "If the valve is\nchoked, replace or clean it, if possible.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P034",
      "10.1 DRAINING THE PUMP",
      true,
      "heading",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P035",
      "When the piping system has been drained, note that there is still some liquid left in the pump.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P036",
      "Remove the remaining liquid by dismantling the pipe plug at the bottom of the pump.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P037",
      "10.2 BEARINGS",
      true,
      "heading",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P038",
      "The pump is equipped with ball bearings which were lubricated for life before leaving the factory.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P039",
      "Therefore, they require no attention but are to be replaced in case of noise or bearing wear.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P040",
      "Place\na bead of grease on the sides of cleaned or newly mounted bearings.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "13:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001",
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P041",
      "As fas as semi-closed\nbearings are concerned, place grease on the open side of the bearing only.",
